@startuml 触发后续任务和工作流完成（第四部分）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50

participant "EventBus" as EventBus
participant "FireWorker" as Worker
participant "TopologyHandler" as Handler
participant "RunningAction" as Action
participant "Graph" as Graph
participant "DB" as DB

== 触发后续任务 ==

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> Handler: 选择 WorkflowRunningStateAction
Handler -> Action: topologyLogicalTransitionEventAction(...)

Action -> Graph: getSuccessors(taskRunnable)
Graph --> Action: 后续任务列表

Action -> Graph: isTriggerConditionMet(successors)
Graph --> Action: true (前置任务已完成)

Action -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
note right of Action: 回到第二部分，触发后续任务\n循环执行直到所有任务完成

== 工作流完成 ==

note over Action: 当所有任务都完成时

Action -> Graph: isAllTaskExecutionRunnableChainFinish()?
Graph --> Action: true

Action -> Graph: isAllTaskExecutionRunnableChainSuccess()?
Graph --> Action: true

Action -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent)

Worker -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker: WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent

Worker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> Action: succeedEventAction(...)

Action -> DB: updateById(状态: SUCCESS, endTime)
Action -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowFinalizeLifecycleEvent)

Action --> Handler: 工作流完成
Handler --> Worker: 处理完成

@enduml
